  _skillName: Flame Breath
  _description: 'Attack Pattern Directive Group 2 - Sustained Pressure ("Flame Breath"
    flavor, hold-to-guard, boss-scale feel). Enemy-cast defense archetype: the
    defending player holds through the attack''s authored duration instead of
    tapping to Dodge/Parry, producing a graduated Guard block percentage
    (BattleHUDController.DefenseOutcome.Guard) instead of a binary avoid/hit -
    dependent on BOTH press timing (vs. the warning-hop tell) and release timing
    (vs. the attack''s own end).'
